Subject: [PATCH 04/48] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20sonda=20pede=20a=20lista=20de=20me?=
 =?UTF-8?q?m=C3=B3ria=20da=20placa=20quando=20nenhum=20driver=20a=20montou?=
